<title>AUSTRIA: TABLE-Mayr-Melnhof H1 earnings higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Mayr-Melnhof H1 earnings higher.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mayr-Melnhof publishes its results for the first six months to June 30, 1997. (Figures in millions of schillings unless stated).</p>
<p>						   1997	   1996</p>
<p> Group sales				  5,530	   5,300</p>
<p> Group pretax profit			  424	     371</p>
<p> Group net profit post minorities	 291	     243</p>
<p>NOTES -- More details expected from Mayr-Melnhof's earnings conference at 0700 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
